  "helix_deltas": [
    "Cab block is SINGLE-cab only. POD Go does NOT support Helix's dual-cab mode (confirmed by project owner; the research draft claimed two modes and was wrong).",
    "No polyphonic pitch (Poly Pitch, Poly Wham, Poly Capo, 12-String, Poly Sustain, Poly Detune).",
    "Single fixed FX Loop block instead of Helix's Send/Return category.",
    "Every amp is also selectable as a Preamp; only standalone preamp is Studio Tube Pre.",
    "Possibly lacks a few newest Helix delays/reverbs (e.g. Cosmos Echo) - unverified."
  ],
  "caveats": [
    "Per-category counts drift +/-1-2 by firmware snapshot; verify against a live v2.5x unit or POD Go Edit for a byte-exact list.",
